{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released","id":1482735,"title":"What do you predict will happen when VTM Bloodlines 2 is finally, if ever, released?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-02T06:00:02-07:00","id":1482735,"title":"What do you predict will happen when VTM Bloodlines 2 is finally, if ever, released?","content":"I personally feel that a lot of people will just wait a couple months for the price to drop and maybe see the reviews to decide whether or not the game is worth buying. The fact that its been delayed for a almost 2 years no doubt would have made a lot people hesitant to buy the game, perhaps fearing a repeat of what happened to Cyberpunk 2077.<br /> <br /> But that's just me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T06:35:04-07:00","id":1482737,"title":"","content":"It'll either be cancelled or flop Hard.<br /> <br /> The drama behind it has alienated the fans of the original game, the series was never enough of a mainstream success for most people to have heard of it, and the company behind it hasn't invested enough in advertising to make it a big deal to the mainstream consumer. The entire fiasco was driven by executive meddling trying to turn it into something that would appeal to the widest audience, only for it to blow up in their face.<br /> <br /> It's the same pattern that's happened with every recently released sequel for a popular 90's/early 2000's movie series. I think the Syndicate needs to fire their current CEOs, they've been infiltrated by the nephandi again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T06:45:08-07:00","id":1482739,"title":"","content":"Bloodlines had a lot of hype. It was the second most anticipated game of two years ago, right after Cyberpunk. The first Bloodlines game is pretty well known and highly rated among RPG fans. It frequently places in the top 25 of any major &quot;best CRPGs of all time&quot; list. <br /> <br /> But yeah, at this point <i>if</i> it ever does come out, I will absolutely be watching some Let's Plays before I even think about spending money on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T07:07:58-07:00","id":1482743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think the Syndicate needs to fire their current CEOs, they've been infiltrated by the nephandi again. </div> </div> </div>I laughed out so loud here LOL <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T08:11:51-07:00","id":1482764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482737#post1482737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It'll either be cancelled or flop Hard.<br /> <br /> The drama behind it has alienated the fans of the original game, the series was never enough of a mainstream success for most people to have heard of it, and the company behind it hasn't invested enough in advertising to make it a big deal to the mainstream consumer. The entire fiasco was driven by executive meddling trying to turn it into something that would appeal to the widest audience, only for it to blow up in their face.<br /> <br /> It's the same pattern that's happened with every recently released sequel for a popular 90's/early 2000's movie series. I think the Syndicate needs to fire their current CEOs, they've been infiltrated by the nephandi again.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, at this point it may be best to stick with continuing their partnership with COG (Choice of Games) and keep releasing more Text adventure games since it seems most people enjoyed them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T13:28:31-07:00","id":1482819,"title":"","content":"I'll probably still get it. <br /> <br /> I slogged through the first one in its original, buggier than a termite nest, released version. The only thing that gave me trepidation (before the studio troubles) was how much the trailers reminded me of the plot of the first game. (New Prince claiming the city as their domain, strange ship drifting ominously offshore, you seem to start off depending on the kindness of a vampire you just met)...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T13:34:23-07:00","id":1482820,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482819#post1482819\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll probably still get it.<br /> <br /> I slogged through the first one in its original, buggier than a termite nest, released version. The only thing that gave me trepidation (before the studio troubles) was how much the trailers reminded me of the plot of the first game. (New Prince claiming the city as their domain, strange ship drifting ominously offshore, you seem to start off depending on the kindness of a vampire you just met)...</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it true that the first game was such a buggy mess, the players themselves had to fix it up?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T13:48:10-07:00","id":1482824,"title":"","content":"Partially.<br /> <br /> There were a number of official patches that addressed a lot of the problems that were present on release, but the financial problems at the studios mean that was never finished as much as the creators would have wanted. Fans then took up the job of finishing things (including restoring cut content), and doing updates for getting the game to run on newer computers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T16:51:26-07:00","id":1482859,"title":"","content":"I predict it will not be the disaster Cyberpunk 2077 was and that they are keeping the game on ice until it is finished because they don't want to repeat the disaster that CD Projekt Red brought on themselves.<br /> <br /> I'm also 90% sure the reason the game was derailed was the business with Chris Avellone and trying to remove all of his content when, in fact, it turned out he wrote most of the game.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T16:58:24-07:00","id":1482860,"title":"","content":"Sad to say I am in the camp of &quot;Cancel or Flop&quot; because there is no &quot;win condition&quot; right now.<br /> <br /> If you were a fan of the original, you probably won't touch anything with modern politics with a 10 foot pole. If you are a modern enthusiast and never played the original, chances are you won't accept anything that doesn't have modern politics in it.<br /> <br /> From a technical stand point if the development hell situation is to be believed, I highly doubt it will be supported post launch if it ever does get made, which means another buggy broken mess of a game.<br /> <br /> Regardless I won't purchase it at full price, it is far more reasonable to wait a couple of years for the price to be cut to less than half and then wait for a sale, by that time the publisher or the fan base has released fixes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T17:20:05-07:00","id":1482863,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thoth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482860#post1482860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sad to say I am in the camp of &quot;Cancel or Flop&quot; because there is no &quot;win condition&quot; right now.<br /> <br /> If you were a fan of the original, you probably won't touch anything with modern politics with a 10 foot pole. If you are a modern enthusiast and never played the original, chances are you won't accept anything that doesn't have modern politics in it.<br /> <br /> From a technical stand point if the development hell situation is to be believed, I highly doubt it will be supported post launch if it ever does get made, which means another buggy broken mess of a game.<br /> <br /> Regardless I won't purchase it at full price, it is far more reasonable to wait a couple of years for the price to be cut to less than half and then wait for a sale, by that time the publisher or the fan base has released fixes.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Because of course, in Bloodlines, all vampires drink soymilk instead of blood, and we bite people to feed on the soymilk they've drunk. That's why both games are set on the West Coast; because that's the only place in America where soymilk is consumed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Give us a bloody break! Women, people of color, and queer/trans were always a part of the audience for Vampire, and not a small part. Excuse them for wanting the game they loved to show a little love back to them. <br /> <br /> This is like the shit in Warhammer 40,000 where every time someone asks where the women space marines are, half the (male) players start menstruating. Because as soon as half of the species is allowed to join your cool club of space knights, they're suddenly no longer cool. When someone is &quot;hurting&quot; you simply by existing in your presence, someone is the problem, alright. It's just not THEM.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T17:33:43-07:00","id":1482867,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482859#post1482859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I predict it will not be the disaster Cyberpunk 2077 was and that they are keeping the game on ice until it is finished because they don't want to repeat the disaster that CD Projekt Red brought on themselves.<br /> <br /> I'm also 90% sure the reason the game was derailed was the business with Chris Avellone and trying to remove all of his content when, in fact, it turned out he wrote most of the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. I kind of gathered that Avellone wrote all or most of the main story content and Mitsoda wrote all or most of the side story content. So between getting rid of the both of their work, they functionally had to rewrite the entire game. That also came with having to revoice the dialogue (assuming they had already gotten a chunk of it voiced) and change all of the lip synching in the scenes to get it to match the new script.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T17:59:26-07:00","id":1482873,"title":"","content":"I assume we are talking about Brian Mitsoda? Sorry for my ignorance, but why was HE canned?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T18:25:18-07:00","id":1482876,"title":"","content":"I think it can be a really nice Swansong for v5.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12348-herr-meister","name":"Herr Meister","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12348_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1114"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T18:51:42-07:00","id":1482881,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482873#post1482873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I assume we are talking about Brian Mitsoda? Sorry for my ignorance, but why was HE canned?</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2\"> Chris Avellone finally explains what the hell happened with Bloodlines 2 - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1455130-chris-avellone-finally-explains-what-the-hell-happened-with-bloodlines-2 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> https://chrisavellone.medium.com/wha...2-1ad557bf2284 (https://chrisavellone.medium.com/what-the-fuck-happened-to-bloodlines-2-1ad557bf2284) I tried to cut and </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T19:13:55-07:00","id":1482883,"title":"","content":"I read the thread, and the link in the thread. If the reason for Brian Mitsoda's firing was given I missed it. <br /> <br /> The closest thing I can get is that someone thinks someone on the board wanted a pg Masquerade game... Which sounds more like Twilight to me. <br /> <br /> Funny, it reminded me of an old idea to write a parody of Twilight, where the parody of Bella already starts the book turned into a vampire, and finds out she's stuck in a scary hostile world.<br /> <br /> A world of darkness, if you will.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T19:59:12-07:00","id":1482888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482867#post1482867\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah. I kind of gathered that Avellone wrote all or most of the main story content and Mitsoda wrote all or most of the side story content. So between getting rid of the both of their work, they functionally had to rewrite the entire game. That also came with having to revoice the dialogue (assuming they had already gotten a chunk of it voiced) and change all of the lip synching in the scenes to get it to match the new script.</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly, I hope they restore the missing content. That's assuming they weren't insane and deleted it all.<br /> <br /> As for Mitsoda, I've only heard (accent on heard) that he was fired because he attempted to stand up for Avellone and said, &quot;It's both of us or none of us.&quot;<br /> <br /> And they chose none of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-02-2022, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T20:00:12-07:00","id":1482889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482883#post1482883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I read the thread, and the link in the thread. If the reason for Brian Mitsoda's firing was given I missed it.<br /> <br /> The closest thing I can get is that someone thinks someone on the board wanted a pg Masquerade game... Which sounds more like Twilight to me.<br /> <br /> Funny, it reminded me of an old idea to write a parody of Twilight, where the parody of Bella already starts the book turned into a vampire, and finds out she's stuck in a scary hostile world.<br /> <br /> A world of darkness, if you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Speaking as someone familiar with those books, they have body counts in the dozens verging on low hundreds.<br /> <br /> The Cullens are vegetarians but for all their memetic pacifist standards, Stephanie Meyer is very clear they're only a papercut and mind-control (they're all dominated into behaving themselves) from ripping the nearest human to shreds.<br /> <br /> Which is to say I kind of wish the last movie had Bella eat her best friend and it actually wouldn't be out of character for the books.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-02-2022, 11:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T20:18:34-07:00","id":1482892,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482889#post1482889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking as someone familiar with those books, they have body counts in the dozens verging on low hundreds.<br /> <br /> The Cullens are vegetarians but for all their memetic pacifist standards, Stephanie Meyer is very clear they're only a papercut and mind-control (they're all dominated into behaving themselves) from ripping the nearest human to shreds.<br /> <br /> Which is to say I kind of wish the last movie had Bella eat her best friend and it actually wouldn't be out of character for the books.</div> </div> </div> </div>See, all that I knew about the books was that Bella never got to become a vampire until the last book, so my plan was to have her become one before the book starts. And the parody of Edward was that he was socially progressive but technically so behind the times he still drives (the legally distinct version of) a Volkswagon Beetle he got in 1960.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T20:49:32-07:00","id":1482894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482863#post1482863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because of course, in Bloodlines, all vampires drink soymilk instead of blood, and we bite people to feed on the soymilk they've drunk. That's why both games are set on the West Coast; because that's the only place in America where soymilk is consumed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Give us a bloody break! Women, people of color, and queer/trans were always a part of the audience for Vampire, and not a small part. Excuse them for wanting the game they loved to show a little love back to them.<br /> <br /> This is like the shit in Warhammer 40,000 where every time someone asks where the women space marines are, half the (male) players start menstruating. Because as soon as half of the species is allowed to join your cool club of space knights, they're suddenly no longer cool. When someone is &quot;hurting&quot; you simply by existing in your presence, someone is the problem, alright. It's just not THEM.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for giving an example of the exact type of response I expect from excessively reactionary individuals, especially the ones which lack the lore understanding of why something does or does not work. This is especially impressive given that all I said was &quot;modern politics&quot; and you added pretty much every buzzword and catch phrase on your own.<br /> <br /> I agree that WoD has always been a transgressive game and setting, the problem is that modern views only allow it to be transgressive in one politically correct direction. This is just the same virtue signaling behavior we saw back in the 80s when Dungeons &amp; Dragons was being blamed for everything wrong in society.<br /> <br /> As for Warhammer 40K, considering that all of the Sisters of Silence, all of the Adeptus Sororitas, about half any given Eldar army, and about half any Dark Eldar army, are females, what are you talking about? Only the most ignorant and surface level interpretation of the setting and lore would suggest there aren't any females in the armies. As for space marines, you are aware of how the gene-seed is supposed to work right, how it turns the aspirants into lesser clones of the male Primarchs, right?<br /> <br /> But perhaps it doesn't matter what the original writers dreamed up or what has been canon for decades, we should focus on the real social crimes of a setting. But if we do that, what sort of individual gets upset about if there are female space marines or not, rather than focusing on the fact that space marines recruit individuals usually younger than the age of 12? Glorifying the use, abuse, and hazardous surgical augmentation of child soldiers seems to be the worse crime here. But please by all means continue with your soap box explanation of how a lack of ovary representation in space marines is so much more horrible than skinning children alive and conscious so that you can add a final augmentation to allow for power armor integration.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T20:55:49-07:00","id":1482895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482888#post1482888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Frankly, I hope they restore the missing content. That's assuming they weren't insane and deleted it all.<br /> <br /> As for Mitsoda, I've only heard (accent on heard) that he was fired because he attempted to stand up for Avellone and said, &quot;It's both of us or none of us.&quot;<br /> <br /> And they chose none of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember when Bloodlines 2 was first announced, the reaction from people in my social circle (and on the internet) seemed to be that it was just some fairly small company getting the rights to Bloodlines and making a cashgrab game. But then they announced that they had Avellone and Mitsoda on board doing the writing, and that's what made the game feel legitimate and authentic. Even if nothing else was good, you knew the writing was going to be solid. They basically used Avellone and Mitsoda as their hype to convince people to buy into the game. <br /> <br /> They might have lost some people if they'd kept Avellone's writing in after his controversies, but they were guaranteed to lose nearly everyone who bought into the game by getting rid of both Avellone and Mitsoda's writing. When that trailer dropped (the cringey one with the Malkavian and the Christmas tree) I know a lot of people who got worried. The graphics looked really bad. &quot;But hey,&quot; I said, &quot;At least you know the writing will be good.&quot; But that's not the case anymore. Instead of being able to coast on the writing, now they're going to have to pull people in with the gameplay and the graphics. Something else besides the writing. And that's going to be almost impossible when they burned their primary bridge to the fans by getting rid of the writers, the one thing that got many of them interested in the game in the first place.<br /> <br /> Of course, based on that trailer, it's possible that the game was in no shape or form to be released anyway, so they just tossed out Avellone and Mitsoda and then tried to blame their need to bring in new writers for the delay. Who knows?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T21:12:36-07:00","id":1482896,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">As a general rule, just as a warning, we're very gunshy about fans complaining about political correctness and woke politics. Feel free to discuss the transgressiveness of WOD and its possibilities but let's keep to mind that Onyx Path supports progressive social values as well as is a horror publisher.<br /> <br /> Which is to say they're hardly contradictory.</span></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T21:21:03-07:00","id":1482897,"title":"","content":"Sorry, apparently this topic was &quot;escalating quickly&quot; so I erased my last post. I took so long to write my response, that the big red letters of warning appeared above my comment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3201,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","user":"Father Enoch","date":".  Fear of a banhammer. 06-03-2022, 12:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3201-father-enoch","name":"Father Enoch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3201_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"285"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T21:47:39-07:00","id":1482899,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Father Enoch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1482735-what-do-you-predict-will-happen-when-vtm-bloodlines-2-is-finally-if-ever-released?p=1482863#post1482863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> This is like the shit in Warhammer 40,000 where every time someone asks where the women space marines are, half the (male) players start menstruating.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given that I am old and not as hip as I used to be, is this statement misogynistic, misandrist, woke, or something else?<br /> <br /> It is misogynistic because it is using female biology in a shaming manner, it assumes that no female 40k enthusiast would care about lore over representation, and that menstruation is some a short hand for emotional response rather than logical discourse.<br /> <br /> It is misandrist due to using a female term for people who identify as males and thus not respecting pronouns. It is also misandrist due to it establishing the notion that the only reason to object to the representation over lore debate is due a &quot;girls have cooties&quot; grade of logic.<br /> <br /> It is woke because no one can just like what they like, rather it must be changed to reflect only the most current form of outrage. Kind of like the movie Thank You for Smoking with the senator who wants to digitally remove cigarettes from old movies to &quot;improve history&quot;. Nothing can be sold today as a classic, only modern sanitized versions can be offered to the public, which is suspiciously 1984 in its thinking. But like I said, I am old like that. <br /> <br /> Yes this is a tad snarky as a reply, but I am also genuinely confused which battle front you are fighting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/727-thoth","name":"Thoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar727_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1689"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T23:38:50-07:00","id":1482903,"title":"","content":"Warhammer 40k runs into the issue that the stuff that mainly gets discussed about, the stuff that sort of ends up being representative of the game, is Space Marines, Chaos Marines and Orks. Stuff like the Tau or Sisters of Silence or such are things you're going to have to delve into the wiki to learn about. So it ends up being a bit problematic when the poster children of 40k are either &quot;No Girls Allowed&quot; or male presenting. It gives a strong impression of the setting, even if it isn't entirely accurate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 06-03-2022, 02:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-03T00:53:14-07:00","id":1482905,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Herr Meis